        "created_at": "2013-01-11T14:55:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I kind of think of her as&nbsp; constantly building momentum. She does little bits of damage here and there, maybe destroys some of the area she's in or disrupts the villain, but it is all part of her larger plan. She's preparing for her one strike, or two, that will completely change the momentum of the battle.</p>",
