        "created_at": "2013-01-13T05:10:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I always assumed the \"burst\" word just meant she was getting faster and faster, which obviously means she could transfer more energy with each punch. It's a really cool concept. As the battle goes on, she's just getting faster.</p>",
